WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.768
- Constant storm to 
try to figure out

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:03.804
what you're about, 
and you change.

00:00:03.804 --> 00:00:05.405
At 26, you're all 
about the hustle.

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:06.807
You're gonna be a billionaire, 
this and that,

00:00:06.807 --> 00:00:09.409
and then you go to the bar one
night, and you fall in love,

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:11.078
and it changes what 
you care about, right,

00:00:11.078 --> 00:00:13.013
and then you have a child, 
and then this happens,

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:15.515
and then that happens, 
things change.

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:18.218
You just have to always
consistently try to figure out

00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:20.721
what's driving you, and
not because other people

00:00:20.721 --> 00:00:23.423
are watching, and not because 
that's what your dad wants,

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:26.093
and not because that's what 
you said was gonna happen,

00:00:26.093 --> 00:00:27.828
and it doesn't look
like it and your family's

00:00:27.828 --> 00:00:29.988
gonna judge you, you just
have to be as real with

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:31.427
yourself as possible and

00:00:31.427 --> 00:00:33.800
that is a very 
difficult struggle,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.270
but when you're not, 
you create enormous

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:38.205
vulnerability and unhappiness.

00:00:38.205 --> 00:00:41.337
(upbeat music)

